---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us" description="Learn about ForexBrokersCompare and our mission to help traders find the best forex brokers.">
  <div class="bg-white">
    <div class="bg-gray-50 py-16">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">About ForexBrokersCompare</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Helping traders make informed decisions since 2024</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <div class="prose prose-lg mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">
          At ForexBrokersCompare, we believe that every trader deserves access to accurate, unbiased information about forex brokers.
          Our mission is to simplify the broker selection process by providing comprehensive reviews, real data, and honest comparisons.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">What We Do</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          We research and review forex brokers from around the world, examining factors such as:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-8 space-y-2">
          <li>Regulation and safety of funds</li>
          <li>Trading costs and spreads</li>
          <li>Trading platforms and tools</li>
          <li>Customer support quality</li>
          <li>Deposit and withdrawal options</li>
          <li>Educational resources</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Our Methodology</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          Our reviews are based on thorough research and real trader feedback. We use a standardized rating system
          to ensure fair comparisons between brokers. Each broker is evaluated across multiple dimensions,
          and ratings are updated regularly to reflect changes in the market.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Trust & Independence</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">
          ForexBrokersCompare is completely independent. We do not accept payment from brokers for better ratings
          or favorable coverage. Our reviews are based solely on our research and the experiences of real traders.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
          Have questions or suggestions? We'd love to hear from you. Reach out to us at
          <a href="mailto:info@forexbrokerscompare.com" class="text-primary-600 hover:underline">info@forexbrokerscompare.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
